  {
   "id": "the-legend-of-sword-and-fairy-7-122105@2.0",
   "gameId": "the-legend-of-sword-and-fairy-7-122105",
   "displayName": "UPDATE 2.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-12-05T05:26:01.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Announcement",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Sword and Fairy 7 PC version Special Update Announcement & Explanation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "In order to provide an even better gaming experience, version 2.0 for Sword and Fairy 7 PC version will be released on Dec. 8, 2022. In order to provide a smooth transition, we have provided the following update explanation:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "1.This update mainly tackles the performance issues of the game. There are no changes to the in-game content.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2.Thanks to a more efficient software packaging system, the size of the game client will be reduced to 30GB.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3.Implemented the latest hard disk reading method to shorten loading and waiting times during gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4.Game performance has been optimized to provide a more stable frame rate and better smoothness in gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Due to the fact that these optimizations are quite extensive, all game files will need to be updated (Total 30GB). In order to minimize any inconveniences, we recommend the following:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1.There are no changes to in-game content. Players who had already cleared the game or otherwise have no desire to update the game can ignore this update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2.For players who do desire this update, we recommend that you do a clean install by uninstalling the previous version of this game, then redownloading and installing the new version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3.We strongly recommend that you make a local or cloud-based backup of your existing game files before updating.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We thank you for your continuing support, and we will strive to continue to optimize and improve the game experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Sword and Fairy Development Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
